    <description>POC Request flow to run after Insert on create or update
8/31/26: Commenting out this resource on 8/31/26 as part of SS-13927. Asset should not be created as a POC Module. 
7/29/26: SS-13737 addition of Cloud Entity module formula
6/17/26: SS-13464 addition of of External Attack Surface module formula
05/04.26: Added the 3 missing modules to the Get and Filter Elements
11/21/25: SS-12131 Create new formula for new Solutions (Core for Operational Technology, Exposure Management for Operational Technology, Endpoint Management for Mobile)
10/28/25: SS-11967 Create new formula to include Jump Gate in Core Plus
9/4/25: SS-11642 Update formula_IntuneTrue (Patch , Deploy &amp; Performance are selected, Intune is TRUE)
8/26/25: SS-10482 Create Account Entitlements in POC Request Approval
8/19/25: SS-11552 Updating formula for Intune and Endpoint AME Solutions (removed Account Entitlement Action)
5/28/25: SS-10482 Create Account Entitlements in POC Request Approval
4/25/25: SS-10645 Formula Updates for the AEM SKUs
4/9/25: SS-10632 Simplifying the decision for populating the SE and CS from either the Account or Opp
3/19/25: SS-10472 Convert POC Approvers Update Process Builder to Flow
12/10/24: Added ISCHANGED check to Approval Stage update element
11/08/24: Adding to decision for email to not send if the POC Modules were manually created. 
10/13/24: Add element to update the POC Record on changes
9/10/24: Automation added to generate licensing even through apex action</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_AccountRVP</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
  OR(
    CONTAINS(TEXT({!$Record.Account__r.Sub_Region__c}), &quot;LATAM&quot;),
    CONTAINS(TEXT({!$Record.Account__r.Sub_Region__c}), &quot;Global MSP&quot;),
    CONTAINS(TEXT({!$Record.Account__r.Sub_Region__c}), &quot;GSI&quot;)
  ),
  IF(
    ISPICKVAL({!$Record.Account__r.Owner.Role_Category__c}, &quot;RVP&quot;),
    {!$Record.Account__r.Owner.Id},
    {!$Record.Account__r.Owner.Manager.Id}
  ),
  {!$Record.Account__r.Owner.Manager.Id}
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_AccountVP</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(AND(NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Opportunity__c})),
NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Opportunity__r.AreaVP__c}))),
{!$Record.Opportunity__r.AreaVP__c}, {!$Record.Account__r.Area_VP__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_AutomateTrue</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!Get_POC_Request.Automate__c} = TRUE,&apos;Automate&apos;,null)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_BenchmarkTrue</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(OR({!Get_POC_Request.Risk__c} = TRUE,
{!Get_POC_Request.Core_Plus__c} = TRUE),
&apos;Benchmark&apos;,null)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_CertificateManagerTrue</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(OR({!Get_POC_Request.Certificate_Manager__c} = TRUE,
{!Get_POC_Request.Core_Plus__c} = TRUE),
&apos;Certificate Manager&apos;,null)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_CloudEntityTrue</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!Get_POC_Request.Tanium_EASM_Solution_Censys__c}= TRUE,
&apos;Cloud Entity&apos;,null)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_ComplyTrue</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(OR({!Get_POC_Request.Comply__c} = TRUE,
{!Get_POC_Request.Risk_Compliance_Plus__c} = TRUE,
{!Get_POC_Request.Risk_Compliance_Standard__c} = TRUE,
{!Get_POC_Request.Exposure_Management_for_Operational_Tech__c} = TRUE),  
